## Working Agreements

- Read the nearest `AGENTS.md` before changing code in a directory.
- Prefer targeted tests for changed code first, then run the broader verify command when practical.
- Do not change generated files unless the source and generation command are both updated.
- Do not add dependencies without clear need.
- Keep edits minimal and local to the task.

## Code Review Expectations

- Call out behavioral risks and migrations.
- Note any untested paths.
- State exactly which commands were run.

## Subproject Rules

Add nested `AGENTS.md` files in subdirectories only if commands, constraints, or architecture materially differ.
